{
  "bodyHash": "OckejKWS+lQ=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">鐵製熔爐<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yWGgGVF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"232\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>靈感來自 cpw 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests</a>&nbsp;模組，新增了幾種不同等級的熔爐。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aTsri2PvSis?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>以無與倫比的速度、可配置的側面、用於煙燻和爆炸的升級組件，以及更多功能，最大化冶煉效率。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你能製作彩虹熔爐並解鎖它的力量嗎？</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/237664/description_09f9eaf4-c6c9-46bf-8ab3-de8890723606.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"283\" height=\"267\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>有問題嗎？請閱讀 <a href=\"https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnaces/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">版本狀態</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x.x：活躍開發中</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge：不在開發中</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric：不在開發中</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>舊版 Fabric：</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces [FABRIC]</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Iron Furnaces 應與大多數模組相容。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>它與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-mmo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project MMO</a> 有明確的相容性。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>推薦的資源包：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Iron Furnaces Framed：[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-furnaces-bordered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252firon-furnaces-framed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>] 由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fEnleey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enleey</a> 製作<br>Shamble's Iron Furnaces：[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fshables-iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>] 由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shamble</a> 製作</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">來自 Thermal 系列的紋理已獲得 CoFH 許可。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>更改日誌</strong><strong>：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.4.2/ifchangelog.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.4.2/ifchangelog.txt</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:left\">此模組是開源的，並根據 Apache 2.0 許可證授權。可根據許可條款在任何專案中修改和使用。</h3>",
